VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_H0::
    .string "My daughter's young man is a\n"
    .string "stubborn sort.\p"
    .string "He has been digging at that tunnel\n"
    .string "for months so he can reach her\l"
    .string "the short way.\p"
    .string "She worries. She goes out there\n"
    .string "most days.$"

VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_WandaBefore::
    .string "WANDA: The tunnel's no good yet.\p"
    .string "Boulders the size of the room we're\n"
    .string "standing in.\p"
    .string "Have you been up to MAUVILLE? The\n"
    .string "GYM there is worth your time.$"

VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_WandaAfter::
    .string "WANDA: You have WATTSON's BADGE.\n"
    .string "He doesn't give those out kindly.\p"
    .string "Listen - my cousin is on the other\n"
    .string "side of that tunnel, in RUSTBORO.\l"
    .string "He's small and he's ill and he wants\l"
    .string "a POKéMON of his own.\p"
    .string "When the boulders come out, I'd\n"
    .string "like you to meet him.$"

VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_WandaIntro::
    .string "WANDA: Go and see the lady in the\n"
    .string "house by the west gate.\p"
    .string "She can tell how your POKéMON feels\n"
    .string "about you. She only does it for\l"
    .string "people I send.\p"
    .string "Say WANDA sent you.$"

VerdanturfTown_WandasHouse_Text_WandaDone::
    .string "WANDA: Any day now. The boulders,\n"
    .string "I mean.\p"
    .string "Say WANDA sent you, at the west\n"
    .string "house.$"
